/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-22T14:47:39-07:00","id":1533020,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1532913-so-who-are-the-clan-justicars-for-the-camarilla-now?p=1532921#post1532921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Malkavian is Juliette Parr, Nosferatu is Molly McDonald, Diana Inandanza is Toreador, Ian Carfax is Tremere, Lucinde is Ventrue</div> </div> </div> </div>I know that Madame Lucinde is a pre-existing (and rather cool) character, but may I please ask if we know anything about those other Justicars?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28339,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","user":"Atticus Cleanclaw","date":".  Finessing my phrasing 03-22-2024, 05:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-22T18:28:39-07:00","id":1533028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Atticus Cleanclaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1532913-so-who-are-the-clan-justicars-for-the-camarilla-now?p=1533020#post1533020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know that Madame Lucinde is a pre-existing (and rather cool) character, but may I please ask if we know anything about those other Justicars?</div> </div> </div> </div>i do believe they have pages on the wiki","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T12:07:01-07:00","id":1533043,"title":"","content":"I'll have to check it when I have time and find out more about them as I have some knowledge on Lucida of the Ventrue clan who is also an Alastor because of her ties to Keminstri of the Followers of Set/Ministry.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-24T07:14:16-07:00","id":1533075,"title":"","content":"Anyone have ideas/suggestions on who could be the new Justicars for the Banu Haqim and Lasombra now that they're Camarilla? Well-known characters like Fatima al-Faqadi and Talley seem overqualified for the job. The easy answer would just be strong PC's I spose","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28284-abugintherug","name":"abugintherug","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28284_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-24T11:25:15-07:00","id":1533082,"title":"","content":"I can see Fatima being the Banu Haqim Justicar, but I could see them creating a childe of Teygerius to fit the bill. As for Lasombra I honestly don\u2019t know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-25T18:07:47-07:00","id":1533144,"title":"","content":"In Beckett's Jyhad Diary, I believe the Assamite/Banu Haquim proposal for membership in the Camarilla put forth Tegyrius as their candidate for Justicar (and Al-Ashrad as their Inner Circle representative).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-26T12:04:32-07:00","id":1533180,"title":"","content":"They were considering Tegyrius as Justicar since the revised clanbook came out twenty plus years ago and I could easily see them going with a childe of his as a possibilty as he is an old and potent member of the 5th generation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-26T15:19:24-07:00","id":1533211,"title":"","content":"In the DA book Dark Tyrants there's the short story <i>Bearer of Ill News </i>which involves one of Boukephos' childer, Geoffrey of Richmond, tracking a priest who had sent a letter to the Vatican giving great detail about his encounter and execution with one of his village's boys who had become a Gangrel, which seems like the kind of thing a Justicar would do.<br /> <br /> Geoffrey interrogates the priest, eliminates a witness who arrived at the wrong time then blackmails the priest into becoming one of his clan's cronies, all while being pretty detached and intimidating. If you haven't read Dark Tyrants yet I couldn't recommend it enough. The priest's letter is in the intro of the 2E DA corebook I believe, its a great story<br /> <br /> Anyway, I've always wanted more involvement with Boukephos in the modern day (he's supposedly killed in 1999 but still sending letters years after) so I think Geoffrey of Richmond would be an excellent character they could bring back as the Lasombra Justicar. He's 5th Gen, has plenty of experience following leads and covering up the Masquerade, and seems pretty resigned to doing his sire's bidding so he's probably more qualified and less of a liability than Talley is. He'd get my vote","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28284,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28284-abugintherug","user":"abugintherug","date":". 03-26-2024, 06:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28284-abugintherug","name":"abugintherug","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28284_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-27T14:12:23-07:00","id":1533277,"title":"","content":"I wonder if Talley has anymore childer other then the two mentioned in Chicago by Night? If so I could see one of them being a good choice or even a childe of Lucita or Policia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join D